A: box thin
dot ".c" above at A
dot ".n" above at A.n
dot " .ne" ljust above at A.ne
dot " .e" ljust at A.e
dot " .se" ljust below at A.se
dot ".s" below at A.s
dot ".sw " rjust below at A.sw
dot ".w " rjust at A.w
dot ".nw " rjust above at A.nw

A: box thin at 2.0*boxwid right of previous box rad 15px
dot ".c" above at A
dot ".n" above at A.n
dot " .ne" ljust above at A.ne
dot " .e" ljust at A.e
dot " .se" ljust below at A.se
dot ".s" below at A.s
